# Weather Sunscreen App - Environment Variables Example
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual values

# ⚠️ SECURITY WARNING — read before setting any EXPO_PUBLIC_* key below ⚠️
# Variables prefixed with EXPO_PUBLIC_ are INLINED into the client JS bundle at build time.
# Anything you put here ships inside the installed app and can be extracted from the binary.
# - Dev/testing with a low-value, rate-limited key: acceptable.
# - Production: DO NOT ship a real provider key this way. Proxy AI requests through a server
#   you control (e.g. an Expo Router API route on EAS Hosting) and keep the secret server-side.
# The app fully works without any AI key (rule-based recommendations are the fallback).

# Vercel AI SDK (Optional - for AI-powered recommendations)
# Get your API key from: https://console.anthropic.com/
EXPO_PUBLIC_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here

# OpenAI (Optional - alternative to Anthropic)
# EXPO_PUBLIC_OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# Google Gemini (Optional - alternative to Anthropic)
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Note: The app works without AI features using rule-based recommendations
# AI features enhance the experience but are not required for core functionality
